# fixture for the empty-material-group case (#1573)
# `gamma` is declared and then immediately superseded, so it owns zero
# indices — its map_Kd must not be allowed to name the mesh-level texture,
# since nothing it covers is ever drawn
mtllib multitex.mtl
v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 0 1 0
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 0 1
usemtl gamma
usemtl alpha
f 1/1 2/2 3/3
